{"name": "Grind TD", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Two Worlds. Two Sides. One War. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Build in the Light. Siege in the Dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 From Defender to Destroyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Master Both Sides of the Rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- DUALITY DEFENSE &amp; SIEGE\uff1aSwitch roles between symmetric worlds for ultimate strategic depth.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"592\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/699faa610053d0da505910d76c934bb1.poster.avif?t=1772605032\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/699faa610053d0da505910d76c934bb1.webm?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/699faa610053d0da505910d76c934bb1.mp4?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"620\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/012d0a3395b7bc99aff5c959c084f1a3.poster.avif?t=1772605032\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/012d0a3395b7bc99aff5c959c084f1a3.webm?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/012d0a3395b7bc99aff5c959c084f1a3.mp4?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- MASTER BOTH SIDES</strong>\uff1aExcel not only in tower placement but also in commanding overwhelming onslaughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"650\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/83853367e42f9993fe0aa441a3873117.poster.avif?t=1772605032\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/83853367e42f9993fe0aa441a3873117.webm?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/83853367e42f9993fe0aa441a3873117.mp4?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Strategic layouts allow you to influence enemy pathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- CROSS-DIMENSIONAL LOOT</strong>\uff1aGear and materials from both worlds await the victor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/c612dceac1715d511e3459a8d75a5ac3.poster.avif?t=1772605032\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/c612dceac1715d511e3459a8d75a5ac3.webm?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257350/extras/c612dceac1715d511e3459a8d75a5ac3.mp4?t=1772605032\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- DEEP PROGRESSION</strong>\uff1aUpgrade towers, enhance minions, and craft legendary gear to define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"642\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" pl